{"id":"n58159-9-4","stage":0,"title":"무겁다 · 重","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58159-9-4-1","ko":"몸도 무거운데 왜 마중을 나왔어요?","zh":"你怀着身孕，怎么还出来接我？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"몸도","meaning":"身体，身子","explanation":"몸：身体，身子；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"몸","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74138","senseId":"1","lemma":"몸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무거운데","meaning":"重，沉","explanation":"무겁다：重，沉；은데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"무겁다","audio":"/audio/91e3eab0a3ea6c9e4a4d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58159","senseId":"9","lemma":"무겁다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마중을","meaning":"接站，接机","explanation":"마중：接站，接机；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"마중","audio":"/audio/810477f1a03c9c2cdb26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54342","senseId":"1","lemma":"마중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나왔어요?","meaning":"出现，出场，参加","explanation":"나오다：出现，出场，参加；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"8","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"955149b012635be1","term":"몸","zh":"身体，身子","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3","entryId":"74138","definition":"指从头到脚组成人或动物形象的整体；或指其状态。","pronunciation":["몸"]},{"id":"91e3eab0a3ea6c9e","term":"무겁다","zh":"重，沉","audio":"/audio/91e3eab0a3ea6c9e4a4d.mp3","entryId":"58159","definition":"因怀孕而肚子变大、行动不便。","pronunciation":["무겁따"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"810477f1a03c9c2c","term":"마중","zh":"接站，接机",